      "text": "Most of my clients aren't lawyers, right? They're not very aware of all the cutting edge and all the details and intricacies of the law. So it's my job to walk you through it really at the beginning of your case, because a lot of the issues are staring us right in the face when you hire us. So we want to be able to say, \"Here's what happened to you."
