      "text": "And of course you can call us anytime. Anyone who has any questions about the law, anything you're going through I'm more than happy to help everybody out and share my wealth of knowledge and experience. Our phone number is 561-998-0770 or toll-free 855-998-0770. Call us. You're facing a situation, you want some legal advice, give us a ring."
