      "speaker": "Mike",
      "text": "Normally, one is \"Oh, we might do this beautiful outdoor ceremony on the beach, but if it rains, we have a backup,\" right? So that's like you always wanna have uninsured/underinsured motorist coverage 'cause you wanna have a backup because Florida's got these weird, weird laws. There's no bodily injury coverage necessary."
